Thu Oct 15 05:02:21 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.5.1:
  * Breaking: env is the child's whole environment as in node-pty,
    no longer merged over the parent's (#48); spread process.env
    to keep inherited variables
  * Build the child environment as node-pty builds it: TERM from
    name, PWD from cwd; drop tmux/COLUMNS/LINES on inherit (#49)
  * Leave src/*.test.ts out of the npm package (#50)
  * Linux ABI unchanged: same eight dlsym entry points, same
    private librust_pty.so path; no consumer rebuild needed
  * Refresh the vendored dependencies

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Sep 30 08:02:58 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.4.11:
  * Add native Windows ARM64 support (#46): ship a rust_pty_arm64.dll
    and select it at run time; the x64 DLL filename is unchanged
  * Move native library filename resolution into src/library.ts
  * Linux ABI unchanged: same 45 vendored crates and no exported-symbol
    changes; %check still verifies all eight dlsym entry points

